    "field": "Historical climatology",
    "problem": "The limited overlap between qualitative documentary evidence and instrumental records has hampered the ability to robustly calibrate, verify, and quantify the uncertainty of high-resolution temperature reconstructions for the pre-instrumental period, a shortcoming this study aims to overcome.",
    "method": "This paper develops monthly, seasonal, and annual temperature reconstructions for Central Europe since AD 1500 by calibrating documentary index series from Germany, Switzerland, and the Czech Republic against homogenized instrumental records for an overlapping period (1760-1854).",
    "task": "The task is to develop monthly, seasonal, and annual temperature reconstructions for Central Europe since AD 1500 by combining documentary index series with instrumental temperature records.",
