            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "Temperatures of the widely discussed warm summer of 2003 (e.g. Luterbacher et al. 2004; Sch\u00e4r et al. 2004) exceed the pre-instrumental unsmoothed CEU.regr + 2 SE values in June, August and JJA. Furthermore, July of 2006 was warmer than the +2 SE level for unsmoothed data. Apart from these few values, however, no recent individual monthly or seasonal temperatures have risen above the +2 SE error level for unsmoothed pre-instrumental temperatures.",
